units real
dimension 3
boundary f f f

atom_style molecular
read_data water_bonds_angles.data

bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 100.0 1.0

angle_style harmonic
angle_coeff 1 30.0 104.5

thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time temp ke pe ebond eangle etotal

timestep 0.1
fix integrator all nve

dump trajectory all custom 5 water_bonds_angles.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz

run 3000
